    "name": "RideLink Microservices API Collection",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman test collection for the RideLink backend microservices platform (IT3130 Application Development).\n\nIncludes:\n- Workflow 1: Account and Access Control\n- Workflow 2: Driver & Vehicle Preparation\n- Workflow 3: Fare Estimation\n- Workflow 4: Ride Request & Driver Assignment\n- Workflow 5: Complete Ride Lifecycle\n- Workflow 6: Final Fare, Payment & Receipt\n- Workflow 7: Negative / Failure Test Scenarios",
